        "subject": "=Welcome to the team, {{ $('Prepare Candidate Data').item.json.candidate_name }}!",
        "message": "=<p>Hi {{ $('Prepare Candidate Data').item.json.candidate_name }},</p><p>Your signed offer is received — welcome aboard as <strong>{{ $('Prepare Candidate Data').item.json.role_title }}</strong> in {{ $('Prepare Candidate Data').item.json.department }}!</p><p>Your start date is <strong>{{ $('Prepare Candidate Data').item.json.start_date }}</strong>. Your manager {{ $('Prepare Candidate Data').item.json.manager_name }} will be in touch with first-day details.</p><p>Onboarding documents and next steps are attached to your onboarding checklist.</p><p>We are thrilled to have you!<br/>Human Resources</p>",
        "options": {}
      },
